            "review_title": "Review at V87 Coffee & Beer",
            "review_text": "Иляна Э\n2 contributions\n0\nEverything they ordered was delicious.\nJul 2026 • Couples\nWe got everything delivered on time. It's delicious, the prices are reasonable. The avocado smoothie just captured the heart, the seafood is delicious, the ostrich was also tasted for the first time, I liked it. On the whole we were satisfied, came here repeatedly, because it really tastes good, even in something in the kitchen at the level of insta-famous cafes and restaurants (ala Michelin, carps, personally my opinion). Prosperity for this institution. If we happen to be here again, 100% we'll be back.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten July 24, 2026",
