            "review_text": "Юлия Ч\n3 contributions\n0\nDelicious, inexpensive.\nMar 2026 • Couples\nWe were with our husband on the last day of their vacation, wanted to try a local pot beer bottling. And did not regret visiting this cafe. The beer was very nice, besides we ordered frog legs, shrimp, scallops, everything was very delicious, the plates were left empty. Prices are low and menus are varied. I highly recommend this place. There is also Russian cuisine\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten March 30, 2026",
