            "review_title": "Review at V87 Coffee & Beer",
            "review_text": "AndrewOkunev\nNizhny Novgorod, Russia53 contributions\n0\nBest maracuilla beer\nApr 2025 • Family\nThe first time, I just went in for a beer, took a set of three types - light, dark, maracaine - and just fell in love with the latest, what a delicious and natural craft sour.\n\nThen the menu was tested with the family:\nChickenburger's daughter called it the best burger she ate.\nI've ordered frog legs twice in a row, so delicious.\n-Pho Bo with proper and rich broth\nAvocados and salmon salad got gold from his wife.\n- Large selection of cocktails\n\nI'll say hookah separately. Big DarkSide selection for scoring. At first it seemed that the hookah was not smoking at all, called the hookah girl, she tried smoking again, it got better. But it's like an open area and high humidity killing coals very quickly. In the process, they even added tobacco to the bowl)\n\nThank you to the owners and the entire V87 team for a great seat!\nI'll definitely be back for a beer of maracuilla!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten May 25, 2025",
